{"hw":"ἀρετάω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀρετάω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀρετάω</span> <span class=\"gk\">[αρ]</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">thrive, prosper,</b> <span class=\"gk\">οὐκ ἀρετᾷ κακὰ ἔργα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.329</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">λαοὶ ἀρετῶσι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.114</span> </span>: in late Prose, <span class=\"gk\">ἀρετῶσα γῆ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.372</span> </span>, al.; <span class=\"gk\">διάνοια</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">280</span> </span>:— <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἐὰν ἀρετήσηται αὐτοῦ τὰ</span>.. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PGiss.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">67.15</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">choose the path of valour,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Procop.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Goth.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.35</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aed.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1</span> </span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prooem.</cite> </div></div>"}